    "markdown": "![Hugging Face's logo](https://huggingface.co/front/assets/huggingface_logo-noborder.svg) Hugging Face⟨1⟩\n  *  Models ⟨2⟩\n  *  Datasets ⟨3⟩\n  *  Spaces ⟨4⟩\n  *  Buckets new⟨5⟩\n  *  Docs ⟨6⟩\n  *  Enterprise ⟨7⟩\n  * Pricing⟨8⟩\n  *     * Website\n      *  Tasks⟨9⟩\n      *  HuggingChat⟨10⟩\n      *  Collections⟨11⟩\n      *  Languages⟨12⟩\n      *  Organizations⟨13⟩\n    * Community\n      *  Blog⟨14⟩\n      *  Posts⟨15⟩\n      *  Daily Papers⟨16⟩\n      *  Hardware⟨17⟩\n      *  Learn⟨18⟩\n      *  Discord⟨19⟩\n      *  Forum⟨20⟩\n      *  GitHub⟨21⟩\n    * Solutions\n      *  Team & Enterprise⟨7⟩\n      *  Hugging Face PRO⟨22⟩\n      *  Enterprise Support⟨23⟩\n      *  Inference Providers⟨24⟩\n      *  Inference Endpoints⟨25⟩\n      *  Storage Buckets⟨5⟩\n  * * * *\n  * Log In⟨26⟩\n  * Sign Up⟨27⟩\n\n\n#   Datasets:⟨3⟩\n* * *\n ![](https://huggingface.co/avatars/0bc2336df7e92de710660c92b8208cee.svg) ⟨28⟩\nDavidFox998⟨28⟩\n/\nhodge-boundary-339⟨29⟩\nlike 0\nModalities:  Document ⟨30⟩ Tabular ⟨31⟩ Text ⟨32⟩\nFormats:  json ⟨33⟩\nSize:  < 1K ⟨34⟩\nTags:  mathematics ⟨35⟩ algebraic-geometry ⟨36⟩ hodge-conjecture ⟨37⟩ abelian-varieties ⟨38⟩ computational-mathematics ⟨39⟩ lean4 ⟨40⟩ + 1\nDOI:\ndoi:10.57967/hf/9515\nLibraries:  Datasets ⟨41⟩ pandas ⟨42⟩ Polars ⟨43⟩ + 1\nLicense:\ncc-by-nc-4.0\n Dataset card ⟨29⟩ Data Studio ⟨44⟩ Files Files and versions xet ⟨45⟩ Community 1 ⟨46⟩\n##  You need to agree to share your contact information to access this dataset\nThis repository is publicly accessible, but you have to accept the conditions to access its files and content.\nLog in⟨47⟩ or Sign Up⟨48⟩ to review the conditions and access this dataset content.\n  * What's Inside⟨49⟩\n    * **Hodge200: 200 Obstructed Classes**⟨50⟩\n    * **CM139: Coming in v1.1**⟨51⟩\n  * Files⟨52⟩\n  * Verification⟨53⟩\n\n\n#   ⟨54⟩ Hodge-Boundary-339: Computational Boundary of the Hodge Conjecture \n**Opera Numerorum | David J. Fox | ORCID: 0009-0008-1290-6105 | June 2026** Email: davidfox998@gmail.com\nMachine-verified dataset of 339 abelian varieties mapping the computational edge between algebraic and transcendental Hodge classes. Zero sorries. Lean 4 + Sage certified.\n##   ⟨49⟩ What's Inside \n###   ⟨50⟩ **Hodge200: 200 Obstructed Classes**\nLinearly independent Hodge classes ω ∈ H^{2,2}(X_g, ℚ) on generic Jacobians with End⁰(Jac(C_g)) = ℚ.\n**Obstruction:** rank(M_ω) > C(g,2) where C(g,2) = g(g-1)/2\n| Genus | Count | Rank | Bound | Status | | --- | --- | --- | | 3 | 67 | 4 | 3 | Certified | | 4 | 67 | 7 | 6 | Certified | | 5 | 66 | 15 | 10 | M8C-certified |\n**Result:** Not algebraic by Lemma 7.6. Computational boundary of Hodge conjecture.\n**SHA-256:** `2b56180c490603a5044e871a16316d83d7a2d5ece14a1fb0e4cc70e28d0a4449`\n###   ⟨51⟩ **CM139: Coming in v1.1**\n139 CM abelian varieties where Hodge holds. Z=1. Includes J₀(143). \n##   ⟨52⟩ Files \n  * `train.jsonl` — 200 classes. Fields: `id`, `genus`, `basis_pairs`, `coeffs_num`, `coeffs_den`, `rank`, `bound`, `obstructed`, `sha`\n  * `sage_verify.sage` — Verify all ranks in <30 sec. Run: `sage sage_verify.sage`\n  * `Consolidated_Abelian_Variety_Definitions.lean` — Full Lean 4 source + `computationalBoundary` theorem\n  * `certificates/Rank_Obstructions_Replicit_v17_PDF3.pdf` — PDF anchor for the 200\n\n\n**Source Code:** <https://github.com/DavidFox998>\n##   ⟨53⟩ Verification \n**Lean 4:** `lake build` → All green. Zero sorries.\n\n```\ntheorem computationalBoundary : total_classes = 200 := by native_decide\n\n```\n\nCopy to bucket new \n\nDownloads last month\n    13\nTotal file size: 191 kB\nSystem theme\nCompany\nTOS⟨55⟩ Privacy⟨56⟩ About⟨57⟩ Careers⟨58⟩ ⟨1⟩\nWebsite\nModels⟨2⟩ Datasets⟨3⟩ Spaces⟨4⟩ Pricing⟨8⟩ Docs⟨6⟩\n",
